{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16801","headline":"赋四相诗 中书令汉阳王张柬之 · 皇甫澈","name":"赋四相诗 中书令汉阳王张柬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周历革元命，天步值艰阻。\n烈烈张汉阳，左袒清诸武。\n休明神器正，文物旧仪覩。\n南向翊大君，西宫朝圣母。\n茂勳镂钟鼎，鸿劳食茅土。\n至今称五王，卓立迈万古。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}